<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77432" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάν-θειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>common to
				all gods</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελετή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					54.7
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάνθειος</span></b> , ὁ, <i>all-embracing divinity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				42(1).549
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				550
			</span></i> (Epid.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>) a month in Lesbos, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				3.710.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανθεία, ἡ</span>, name of a plaster, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάνθειον</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερόν</span>), τό,
				<i>temple</i> or <i>place consecrated to all gods</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				834a12
			</span></i>; esp. <i>the Pantheon</i> at Rome, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				53.27
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν πλανητῶν
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.483
			</span></i>.</div>
